# GhostDash Production Rules

## Scope

These rules apply to GhostDash, Magic Mike, production chat, phone-call preview, voice mode, tool policy, guardrails, and admin configuration.

## Product truth

Magic Mike is a Ride Electric consumer customer voice agent.

Magic Mike is not:

```text
a finance agent
a board documenter
a generic RAG/document bot
an Odoo/ERP assistant
a debugging surface
```

## Production chat rule

`/prod_chatui/` must always be clean production mode.

Required runtime facts:

```text
agent_id = magic_mike
agent_category = consumer_customer
route_mode = production_chat
public_presenter_required = true
retail_output_guard_required = true
diagnostics_visible = false
```

## Forbidden production leakage

Magic Mike production output must not contain:

```text
Odoo
tool blocked
backend
orchestrator
citations
scorecard
Execution Truth
Source mode
semantic
structured
provided documents
grounded information
database
raw payload
trace_id
```

If any appears, block and rewrite before display and before speech.

## Odoo rule

Odoo is forbidden for Magic Mike in consumer customer production mode.

Do not hide Odoo only in the prompt. Remove it from backend tool policy and runtime capability.

## Phone-call mode rule

Open Streaming / Preview must behave like a phone call.

```text
one click starts call
mic stays open
interim transcript displays only
final transcript auto-submits once
Magic Mike replies while streaming
ElevenLabs audio plays selected voice
user can interrupt by speaking
End Call stops all resources
```

## Voice rule

Do not use browser speechSynthesis in production phone-call mode.
Do not use repeated MP3 preview calls in phone-call mode.
Use backend ElevenLabs websocket with Flash v2.5 and PCM playback.

## Guardrail rule

Pipeline:

```text
STT transcript
-> input guardrail
-> runtime/tool routing
-> output guard
-> PublicResponsePresenter
-> display
-> speech
```

Never send raw RAG/tool output directly to ElevenLabs.

## Code quality rule

Do not add static one-off patches where a runtime boundary is broken.
Fix the path at the correct layer.

Do not create duplicate state systems.
Do not create duplicate database tables without proving no existing schema fits.
Do not use global agent/tool state for production agents.

## Proof rule

Every completed change must include:

```text
files changed
tests run
before/after behaviour
runtime proof
network/audio proof for voice changes
```
